  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You were born with an affinity for ancient magic older than mortal spellcraft, a force known as the Wyrd. Sages claim that the Wyrd flows from the same deep well as the Fey, its threads woven through the hidden paths of the Otherworld where time bends. It is the pattern that binds past, present, and future, the ever-weaving tapestry of all things. Though the future is not predetermined, it carries a powerful momentum, an inevitability shaped by all that has come before. Your gift allows you to slow time and reach into this pattern, touching the strands that the Fey themselves guard and twist. With careful will, you can alter these threads, bending what should happen into what might happen, and shielding the world from destinies best left unraveled.</p>"
    },
    "source": {
      "custom": "Legends of the Round Table: Chivalric Handbook",
